ADDENDA <Act No. 20936, Apr. 22, 2025>
Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Act shall enter into force 6 months after the date of its publication; provided, the amended provisions of Articles 7-6 and 8 (2) 4 shall enter into force on January 1, 2027.
Article 2 (Applicability to persons subject to reduction of charges)
The amended provisions of Article 11-2 (2) 5 through 7 shall begin to apply to cases where authorization or approval is granted after the enforcement of this Act, according to the following classifications:
1. Approval of an implementation plan for a complex development project under Article 18 of the Act on Support for Urban Complex Development;
2. Approval of an urban public housing complex project plan under Article 40-8 of the Special Act on Public Housing;
3. Approval of an implementation plan under Article 46 of the Special Act on Promotion of and Support for Urban Regeneration.

